# Editors / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# The built web app is embedded at build time. The placeholder is committed so
# `go build ./...` works on a fresh clone, where dist/ would otherwise be empty
# and the //go:embed pattern would match nothing and fail to compile.
#
# The generic "dist/" rule above excludes this directory itself (it has no
# leading slash, so it matches a directory named dist at any depth) — and
# once a directory is excluded, git will not look inside it for a later
# negation, no matter the order. It has to be un-excluded first.
!/internal/webui/dist/
/internal/webui/dist/*
!/internal/webui/dist/placeholder.html
